e in intense battles against formidable human bosses.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/33aa19d5267ed496ecc7574121afc90a.poster.avif?t=1764606863\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/33aa19d5267ed496ecc7574121afc90a.webm?t=1764606863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/33aa19d5267ed496ecc7574121afc90a.mp4?t=1764606863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover human &quot;artifacts&quot; (garbage) and use them to your advantage.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/314ae0688bd0929f075eb13468fb2b07.poster.avif?t=1764606863\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/314ae0688bd0929f075eb13468fb2b07.webm?t=1764606863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1688640/extras/314ae0688bd0929f075eb13468fb2b07.mp4?t=1764606863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with up to 7 other friends in thrilling 8-player multiplayer mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your goblin's appearance and abilities to suit your playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you save the island and secure a future for goblin-kind, or will your tribe be swept away by the relentless tide of human aggression? The fate of the goblins rests in your hands!</p>","developers":["Kilowatt Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"de